  "In the POSE card, turn Controls on. A small circle appears on each joint: shoulder, elbow, knee and so on. You pose the character by grabbing these circles.": "在 POSE 卡片中打开控件。每个关节上都会出现一个小圆环：肩、肘、膝等。抓住这些圆环就能给角色摆姿势。",
  "In the SAVE card, press ○ Save. You can give it a name first. Click a saved pose later and the character returns to exactly that pose.": "在“保存”卡片中按 ○ 保存。可以先起个名字。以后点击已保存的姿势，角色就会准确回到那个姿势。",
  "In the TOOLS card, press ◉ Capture (Ctrl+Shift+S also works). Choose a size, check it with Preview render, then press Add to board. The pose becomes an image on your board, ready to draw over.": "在“工具”卡片中按 ◉ 捕捉（Ctrl+Shift+S 也可以）。选择尺寸，用预览渲染检查，然后按添加到画板。姿势会变成画板上的一张图片，可以在上面继续画。",
  "In the image editor, Ctrl + wheel zoom keeps the point under the cursor in place. Off zooms around the canvas centre.": "在图像编辑器中，Ctrl+滚轮缩放会固定光标下的点。关闭时围绕画布中心缩放。",
